Z||000006||theogre||04-24-2000||08:53 AM||||Those pages are partly updated, mostly they are just conversions with a couple obsolite items fixed. <P>I did start some updates about the sail pannels but not all of it is there yet. Nearly all of those pages have updates comming. The door page and the trunk latch page are both getting things added or corrected. There is a whole new section comming on the ECM and sensors.<P>I just wanted to make sure the majority of readers could see everything. Especially since I let Office 2k mostly autoformat the conversion. You never know what microsloth is going to do or if it will work on servers besides IIS.<P>Curious.... does balloon help work in Netscape? If you hold your pointer over a link in the left frame they should all pop up a little text box.<P>please continue to check the pages if you haven't done so already. If anyone finds any other errors let me know. Those articles where all written a year ago and I haven't looked at them much since. (The cooling system article is also being worked on again.)||||reg||1
